OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear spells and cloudier periods
OL,7,Fovernight. Most places staying dry,
OL,8,Falthough isolated heavy showers remain
OL,9,Fpossible. Mist or fog patches forming
OL,10,Fin places as the wind remains light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FWarm sunny spells throughout
OL,13,Fthe day and remaining dry for most.
OL,14,FThe southwesterly wind strengthens for
OL,15,Fa time during the afternoon.
OL,16,FTemperatures remaining slightly above
OL,17,Faverage.
